@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Registration : User enters details
Registration --> UserTypeIdentification : Details submitted
UserTypeIdentification --> Idle : Incorrect details
UserTypeIdentification --> Login : Correct details
Login --> Idle : Incorrect login details
Login --> CitizenDashboard : Successful login
CitizenDashboard --> DocumentUpload : Upload documents
CitizenDashboard --> ProfileView : View profile
CitizenDashboard --> CertificateApplication : Apply for certificate
DocumentUpload --> CitizenDashboard : Upload complete
CertificateApplication --> CitizenDashboard : Application submitted
CitizenDashboard --> Logout : User wants to end session
Logout --> [*]

CitizenDashboard --> CertificateReapplication : Reapply for certificate
CertificateReapplication --> CitizenDashboard : Reapplication submitted

[*] --> RegistrarIdle
RegistrarIdle --> CertificateRequest : Request certificates
CertificateRequest --> RegistrarIdle : Certificate received
CertificateRequest --> CertificateRequest : Request more certificates

RegistrarIdle --> RegistrarLogout : Registrar wants to end session
RegistrarLogout --> [*]

@enduml
